                                "sense_id": "a37da4f2-171c-3cea-a717-16ca943f6817",
                                "text": "De ondernemer had een sterke handelsgeest en wist succesvolle deals te sluiten.",
                                "translation": "The entrepreneur had a strong mercantile mindset and knew how to close successful deals.",
                                "english": "The entrepreneur had a strong mercantile mindset and knew how to close successful deals."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c61a4330-dadc-497d-9b65-2fc74dc8c51d",
                                "sense_id": "a37da4f2-171c-3cea-a717-16ca943f6817",
                                "text": "De ontdekkingsreizigers hadden een avontuurlijke handelsgeest en zochten nieuwe handelsroutes.",
                                "translation": "The explorers had an adventurous trader's spirit and sought new trade routes.",
                                "english": "The explorers had an adventurous trader's spirit and sought new trade routes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a484dc5a-d473-452a-b4fb-de5cd254b873",
                                "sense_id": "a37da4f2-171c-3cea-a717-16ca943f6817",
                                "text": "De handelsgeest van de kooplieden in de middeleeuwen droeg bij aan de groei van de handel.",
                                "translation": "The mercurial mindset of the merchants in the Middle Ages contributed to the growth of trade.",
